MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
Macros with arguments.
MCDEF GREET; AS <Hello, %A1.!>
GREET world;
GREET ML/I;
MCDEF JOIN,; AS <%A1.-%A2.>
JOIN left,right;
MCDEF COUNT,,; AS <%A1./%A2./%A3.>
COUNT one,two,three;
A name on its own is a whole delimiter structure, so the simplest
macro has no arguments and needs no brackets round its replacement
text: the rest of the line is it.
MCDEF ARRSIZE AS 6
an array of ARRSIZE
MCDEF Bob AS Alice
Bob and Bob again
